  "title": "PROBE iEEG",
  "description": "PROBE iEEG is an intracranial EEG (stereo-EEG) dataset from six participants, with 12 runs each, accompanied by pre- and post-surgery MRI. The dataset includes raw iEEG recordings together with events, channel and electrode metadata. A known issue is that all 72 signal files are identical, so the recordings cannot be treated as 72 distinct runs.",
